# 版本更新说明

## 1.9.0.302（2025-12-12）

|依赖版本|本次特性变更|
|:---------------------------------------------------|:-------------------------|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:video-editor-sdk:1.9.0.302|**修复特性** 优化包大小，优化音频焦点获取逻辑。|

温馨提示：如果您在集成SDK或上架应用到华为应用市场时遇到问题，可以[在线提单](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/support/feedback/#/)。

## 历史版本

### 1.9.0.301（2023-07-07）

|依赖版本|本次特性变更|
|:--------------------------------------------------|:--------------|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:video-editor-ai:1.9.0.301|**修复特性** 修复Bug。|

### 1.9.0.300（2022-12-27）

|依赖版本|本次特性变更|
|:--------------------------------------------------|:----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:video-editor-ai:1.9.0.300|**新增特性** 新增[一键染发](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/ai-sdk-0000001286259938#section192771748298)、[头部分割](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/ai-sdk-0000001286259938#section0243184203913)能力，对应新增接口和类有：[HVEAICloudListener<T>](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/videoai-hveaicloudlistener-0000001419449452)、[HVEAIBodySeg](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/videoai-hveaibodyseg-0000001468047037)、[HVEAIColorBean](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/videoai-hveaicolorbean-0000001468405697)和[HVEAIHairDyeing](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/videoai-hveaihairdyeing-0000001468007009)（需另外添加对应依赖，请参见[添加编译依赖](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/integrating-sdk-0000001147588347#section3391123617333)）。|

### 1.0.0.301和1.1.0.305（2022-08-31）

|依赖版本|本次特性变更|
|:--------------------------------------------------------|:---------------------------------------------|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:video-editor-ai:1.7.0.301|**优化特性** 支持适配Android 13，targetSdkVersion修改为33。|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:video-editor-recorder:1.0.0.301|**修改特性** 修复同时集成原子能力SDK和屏幕录制SDK，编译冲突的问题。|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:video-editor-ui:1.1.0.305|**修改特性** 升级三方开源依赖版本，解决CVE漏洞。|

### 1.0.0.300（2022-08-15）

|依赖版本|本次特性变更|
|:--------------------------------------------------------|:----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:video-editor-ai:1.7.0.300|新增SDK，可独立调用动态照片（该功能及相关内容已下架）、一键微笑（该功能及相关内容已下架）、AI着色（该功能及相关内容已下架）、一键动效、精彩片段和目标分割AI能力，包体更小、接口更灵活、集成更便捷，欢迎广大开发者集成使用！|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:video-editor-recorder:1.0.0.300|新增SDK，提供完整的屏幕录制能力，可自定义存储路径，录制分辨率和通知栏样式等，接口简单，集成接入快速，欢迎广大开发者集成使用！|

### 1.1.0.304（2022-06-21）

|---------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:video-editor-ui:1.1.0.304|**修改特性** 解决小米、vivo应用商店上架时出现的隐私合规问题。|

### 1.1.0.303（2022-04-27）

|依赖版本|本次特性变更|
|:--------------------------------------------------|:-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本： com.huawei.hms:video-editor-ui:1.1.0.303|**优化特性** 优化本地预置字体显示缩略图。 **修改** **特性** * 修复部分手机素材缩放异常问题。 * 修复Android 10 ~ 13手机无法获取本地媒体资源列表问题。|

### 1.4.0.300（2022-02-28）

|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本：com.huawei.hms:video-editor-sdk:1.4.0.300 **新增特性** * 新增[关键帧能力](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/keyframe-capability-0000001200642524)、文字气泡和花字能力。 * [编排素材](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/operations-guide-0000001201961634)新增： * "我的素材"、参数配置、渠道管理、终端归属等功能，欢迎登录AGC网站了解。 * 新增[栏目介绍](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/columns-introduction-0000001248094913)。 * 新增接口：[com.huawei.hms.videoeditor.sdk](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/sdk-overview-0000001156929208)新增[HVEKeyFrameAbility](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hveeeyframeability-0000001245615369)。 * 新增方法： * [HVETimeLine](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvetimeline-0000001202889223)新增[copyAndInsertAsset](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvetimeline-0000001202889223#section35185772113)和[copyAndInsertEffect](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvetimeline-0000001202889223#section1684419584212)。 * [HVEWordAsset](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvewordasset-0000001201930665)新增[setBubbleWord](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvewordasset-0000001201930665#section0622192511220)、[setFlowerWord](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvewordasset-0000001201930665#section11827103541116)、[removeBubbleWord](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvewordasset-0000001201930665#section152112269124)和[removeFlowerWord](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvewordasset-0000001201930665#section658112417129)。 * 新增错误码：[HVEAIError](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hveaierror-0000001231053689)新增[AI_ERROR_NETWORK](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hveaierror-0000001231053689#section68103459184)和[AI_ERROR_TIMEOUT](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hveaierror-0000001231053689#section8174201618271)。 **修改特性** * AI_ERROR_NORMAL修改为[AI_ERROR_UNKNOWN](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hveaierror-0000001231053689#section65509158378)。 * [AI_ERROR_CPU_NOT_SUPPORT](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hveaierror-0000001231053689#section72381242201217)、[AI_ERROR_UNKNOWN](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hveaierror-0000001231053689#section65509158378)和[TIMER_PLAY_PERIOD](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/huaweivideoeditor-0000001157249152#section1254213477129)的值变更。 **删除特性** [HVEVideoLane](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevideolane-0000001157249168)删除moveAssetIndex(List<Integer> indexList)。|

### 1.3.0.300（2021-12-28）

|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本：com.huawei.hms:video-editor-sdk:1.3.0.300 **新增特性** * AI算法支持按需依赖，优化包大小，请参见[添加编译依赖](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/integrating-sdk-0000001147588347#section3391123617333)。 * 新增[人脸遮挡](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-Guides/ai_algorithm_integration-0000001166552824#section9216527155412)。 * 新增类：[com.huawei.hms.videoeditor.sdk.bean](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/sdk_bean_overview-0000001156929214)新增[HVEAIFaceStickerInput](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hveaifacestickerinput-0000001224284951)和[HVEAIFaceTemplate](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hveaifacetemplates-0000001179125130)。 * 新增方法：[HVEVisibleAsset](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevisibleasset-0000001156050674)新增[addFacePrivacyEffect](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevisibleasset-0000001156050674#section12687161616251)、[getAIFaceTemplates](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevisibleasset-0000001156050674#section919471282514)、[initFacePrivacyEngine](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevisibleasset-0000001156050674#section381917362520)、[interruptFacePrivacyDetect](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevisibleasset-0000001156050674#section3566914132511)、[removeFacePrivacyEffect](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevisibleasset-0000001156050674#section374441832518)和[startFacePrivacyDetect](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevisibleasset-0000001156050674#section649720910251)。 * 新增字段：[HVEMaterialConstant](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvematerialconstant-0000001165651670)新增[STICKER_FACE](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvematerialconstant-0000001165651670#section9955193616253)。 * 新增曲线变速功能。 * 新增类：[com.huawei.hms.videoeditor.sdk.bean](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/sdk_bean_overview-0000001156929214)新增[HVESpeedCurvePoint](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvespeedcurvepoint-0000001224821733)。 * 新增方法： * [HVEVideoAsset](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevdeoasset-0000001155730670)新增[getCurvePoints](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevdeoasset-0000001155730670#section19626615141213)和[getCurveName](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevdeoasset-0000001155730670#section15627121514121)。 * [HVEVideoLane](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevideolane-0000001157249168)新增[addCurveSpeed(int index, String name, List<HVESpeedCurvePoint> speedCurvePoints)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevideolane-0000001157249168#section1495772031414)、[addCurveSpeed(int index, String name, String path)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevideolane-0000001157249168#section136761310102010)和[removeCurveSpeed](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevideolane-0000001157249168#section1576210390232)。 * 新增字段：[HVEMaterialConstant](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvematerialconstant-0000001165651670)新增[CUVER_SPEED_FATHER_COLUMN](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvematerialconstant-0000001165651670#section1944875117172)。 * 新增资源裁剪功能。 * 新增类：[com.huawei.hms.videoeditor.sdk.bean](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/sdk_bean_overview-0000001156929214)新增[HVECut](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvecut-0000001223526445)。 * 新增方法：[HVEVisibleAsset](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevisibleasset-0000001156050674)新增[getHVECut](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevisibleasset-0000001156050674#section695091634211)和[setHVECut](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevisibleasset-0000001156050674#section643515519397)。 * AI算法新增类：[com.huawei.hms.videoeditor.sdk.ai](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/sdk-ai-overview-0000001161896828)新增[HVEAIError](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hveaierror-0000001231053689)。 * 视频泳道新增方法：[HVEVideoLane](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevideolane-0000001157249168)新增[appendImageAsset(String path, long duration, int width, int height)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevideolane-0000001157249168#section67150812414)和[appendImageAsset(String path, long startTime, long duration, int width, int height)](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hvevideolane-0000001157249168#section2523125914120)。 * 渲染功能新增方法：[HuaweiVideoEditor](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/huaweivideoeditor-0000001157249152)新增[stopRenderer](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/huaweivideoeditor-0000001157249152#section93711575123)。|

### 1.2.0.305（2021-12-01）

|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本：com.huawei.hms:video-editor-sdk:1.2.0.305 **新增特性** 新增字段：[HVEExclusiveFilter](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hveexclusivefilter-0000001162215364)新增[FILTER_TYPE_CLONE](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hveexclusivefilter-0000001162215364#section876753810019)和[FILTER_TYPE_SINGLE](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/hveexclusivefilter-0000001162215364#section148093220223)。 **优化特性** 优化了AI算法的时延和准确性。|

### 1.1.0.302（2021-11-08）

|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本：com.huawei.hms:video-editor-ui:1.1.0.302 **修改特性** * 修复集成高于androidx.appcompat:appcompat:1.2.0的版本导致UI子菜单面板显示异常的问题。 * 修复稳定性问题。|

### 1.2.0.300（2021-11-01）

|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本：com.huawei.hms:video-editor-sdk:1.2.0.300 **新增特性** 新增视频编辑原子能力SDK，提供基础编辑能力接口，方便灵活集成，支持自定义UI界面。 * 新增能力如下： * 剪辑基本操作，包括分割、删除、音量、比例、变速、画布、旋转、动画、蒙版、镜像、复制、替换、倒放 * 画布背景、比例设置 * 添加滤镜，可自由调整亮度、对比度、饱和度、色调、色温、锐化等参数 * 添加音乐/音效，可对音频淡入淡出、音量调节、变速等 * 画中画功能 * 导出视频，设置导出视频的分辨率、帧率和编码方式 * AI算法：一键染发、AI着色（该功能已下架）、动态照片（该功能已下架）、人物追踪和专属滤镜 * 降采样 * 工程草稿保存、恢复、删除、复制能力 * 素材管理 * 新增包有： * [com.huawei.hms.videoeditor.materials](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/materials-overview-0000001205956101)：云侧素材管理模块 * [com.huawei.hms.videoeditor.sdk](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/sdk-overview-0000001156929208)：编辑管理模块 * [com.huawei.hms.videoeditor.sdk.ai](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/sdk-ai-overview-0000001161896828)：AI算法模块 * [com.huawei.hms.videoeditor.sdk.asset](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/sdk-asset-overview-0000001202689205)：资源模块 * [com.huawei.hms.videoeditor.sdk.bean](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/sdk_bean_overview-0000001156929214)：基本数据类型模块 * [com.huawei.hms.videoeditor.sdk.effect](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/sdk_effect_overview-0000001201930671)：特效模块 * [com.huawei.hms.videoeditor.sdk.lane](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/sdk_lane_overview-0000001157249166)：泳道模块 * [com.huawei.hms.videoeditor.sdk.util](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/sdk_util_overview-0000001165661440)：工具类|

### 1.1.0.301（2021-08-27）

|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本：com.huawei.hms:video-editor-ui:1.1.0.301 **新增特性** * 新增保存和删除草稿功能。 * 新增[DraftInfo](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/draftinfo-0000001190082373)类。 * [MediaApplication](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/mediaapplication-0000001149508209)类中新增[START_MODE_IMPORT_FROM_DRAFT](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/mediaapplication-0000001149508209#section18526195318913)常量。 * [MediaApplication](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/mediaapplication-0000001149508209)类中新增[deleteDrafts](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/mediaapplication-0000001149508209#section7847194925613)(List<String> draftIds)和[getDraftList](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/mediaapplication-0000001149508209#section121912051175620)()方法。 * [VideoEditorLaunchOption.Builder](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/videoeditorlaunchoption-builder-0000001102988094)类中新增[setDraftId](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/Media-References/videoeditorlaunchoption-builder-0000001102988094#section5529915135510)(String id)方法。 * 新增对操作的撤销和恢复功能。 * 文字编辑中新增设置文字动画、花字、气泡、文字模板。 * 新增提取本地视频中的音频功能。 * 音频泳道片段新增音乐淡入淡出功能。 * 新增色度抠图、关键帧、曲线变速功能。 * 色彩调节新增光感、高光、阴影、褪色、暗角、颗粒。|

### 1.0.0.300（2021-07-15）

|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|Android版本：com.huawei.hms:video-editor-ui:1.0.0.300 华为推出了全新的Video Editor Kit 1.0.0.300版本，此次版本为Video Editor Kit首个商用版本，支持导入、编辑、导出视频，帮助您快速实现自有App的视频编辑功能，欢迎广大开发者接入使用。|

